---
export interface Props { featured?: any; postCount?: number; }
const { featured, postCount=39 }=Astro.props;
---
<section class="hero-security"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><p class="kicker">Digital safety, without the jargon</p><h1 class="hero-title mt-7">Protect your accounts <em>before</em> something goes wrong.</h1><p class="hero-dek">Clear, source-backed guides and free tools for passwords, two-factor login, privacy, backup, and account recovery. Each guide includes a reference list so readers can check the relevant FTC, CISA, NIST, vendor, or other public-interest guidance.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="/tools/" class="btn btn-primary">Check my security</a><a href={featured ? `/posts/${featured.slug}/` : '/posts/'} class="btn btn-ghost">Browse the guides →</a></div><div class="hero-trust"><span>✓ No sign-in required</span><span>◎ Browser-based checklist</span><span>◌ Free access</span><span>{postCount} in-depth guides</span></div></div><aside class="score-panel"><p class="kicker">Security checkup</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold">Review four security basics</h2><div class="mt-5"><p class="check-row"><b>1</b>Unique passwords</p><p class="check-row"><b>2</b>Email MFA or passkey</p><p class="check-row"><b>3</b>Current device updates</p><p class="check-row"><b>4</b>Documented recovery path</p></div><p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[var(--ink-3)]">Answer the checklist to calculate your own result. No score is shown before you begin.</p><a class="btn btn-accent mt-4 w-full" href="/tools/">Start the checkup →</a></aside></div></section>
